  "about": {
    "title": "About World Championships Decks 2024",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: World Championships Decks 2024 came out on 16 May 2025 and has 103 cards, in 8 players’ decks. These are gold-bordered reprints of decks from that year’s World Championships, with a player’s signature and a different card back, so they can’t be used in tournaments.",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
    ]
